Module demo.aliases.

Define Applicant has name as Text, score as Score, tags as Tags.

Rule approve given applicant as Applicant, produce Decision:
  If applicant.score at least 600:
    Return "approve".
  Return "review".

// 别名可以在使用之后定义
Type Score as Int.

Type Tags as list of Text.

Type Decision as Text.

Type Lookup as map Text to Score.
